name: Zany Joker — three-of-a-kind mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Zany Joker gives +12 Mult if the hand contains Three of a Kind. First-shop trips
  payoff: level Three of a Kind with Venus, stack the chip counterpart Wily Joker,
  and The Trio (X3 on trips) for the multiplicative jump.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: ZanyJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: TheTrio
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: WilyJoker
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 30
  - planetCard: Venus
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 20
